msgstr "Spring dette trin over"

#: inc/hnf-optin-form.php:466
msgid "Your Website Overview"
msgstr "Oversigt over din hjemmeside"

#: inc/hnf-optin-form.php:467
msgid "Your Site URL, WordPress & PHP version, plugins & themes. This data lets us make sure this plugin always stays compatible with the most popular plugins and themes."
msgstr "Din websteds-URL, WordPress & PHP-version, plugins og temaer. Disse data giver os mulighed for at sikre, at dette plugin altid forbliver kompatibelt med de mest populære plugins og temaer."

#: inc/hnf-optin-form.php:469
msgid "Your Profile Overview"
msgstr "Oversigt over din profil"

#: inc/hnf-optin-form.php:470
msgid "Your name and email address."
msgstr "Dit navn og din e-mailadresse."

#: inc/hnf-optin-form.php:472
msgid "Admin Notices"
msgstr "Administrator noter"

#: inc/hnf-optin-form.php:473
msgid "Updates, Announcement, Marketing. No Spam, I promise."
msgstr "Opdateringer, Meddelelse, Markedsføring. Ingen spam, det lover jeg."

#: inc/hnf-optin-form.php:475
msgid "Plugin Actions"
msgstr "Plugin-handlinger"

#: inc/hnf-optin-form.php:476
msgid "Active, Deactive, Uninstallation and How you use this plugin's features and settings. This is limited to usage data. It does not include any of your sensitive headerandfooter data, such as traffic. This data helps us learn which features are most popular, so we can improve the plugin further."
msgstr "Aktivere, deaktivere, afinstallere og hvordan du bruger dette plugins funktioner og indstillinger. Dette er begrænset til brugsdata. Det inkluderer ikke nogen af dine følsomme headerandfooter-data, såsom trafik. Disse data hjælper os med at lære, hvilke funktioner der er mest populære, så vi kan forbedre plugin'et yderligere."

